    <item>
      <title>谷歌的AI天才又双叒叕跑了：Noam Shazeer二度出走，这次OpenAI捡了个“Transformer级”大礼包？</title>
      <link>http://192.168.50.247:1313/insights/ainoam-shazeeropenaitransformer-20260618161010238-1/</link>
      <pubDate>Thu, 18 Jun 2026 16:10:10 +0800</pubDate>
